---
# The wasm Apps' job tokens on dev (AP-159, T-3539): the federated mechanism is seen working
# here (T-2868, a throwaway federated-jwt client got a token, a wrong ServiceAccount got
# invalid_client), so the token service and the job identities' namespace are on, and the
# Portal provisions each App's appjob ServiceAccount and client there.
wasm-host:
  tokens:
    enabled: true
  identities:
    enabled: true
